    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Cabinet Vauclair & Associés tender requires an intelligent assistance tool that provides quick access to reliable information, drafting assistance, client-file handling support, and collaboration features, with response times below 2 seconds, high availability during business hours, and integration with the firm's production tools via API-type interfaces." ;
