    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design a technical architecture that meets these requirements, ensures data sovereignty through hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, and minimizes dependency on non-European suppliers?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these requirements, I propose designing a technical architecture based on the firm's Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. we can host a technical architecture based on our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform on the firm's SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring data sovereignty and minimizing dependency on non-European suppliers. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform provides the necessary components for an intelligent assistance tool, including document ingestion, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform model-agnostic design allows we to choose a sovereign European open-weight model that is fully auditable and has strong grounding and citation behavior, which aligns with The Cabinet Vauclair & Associés tender requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure quick access to reliable information and response times below 2 seconds, we can leverage our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform high-performance capabilities, with median latency of 1.3 seconds and p95 latency below 2.5 seconds. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform also supports horizontal scaling to handle peak loads during business hours, ensuring high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For integration with the firm's production tools, we API-first design approach using REST and webhooks will enable seamless embedding in existing work environments. we can utilize connectors and adapters for accounting-production and payroll software, document-management systems, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environments, developed in partnership with Ligeo Conseil." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
