        ex:hasText "Strict partitioning and logical isolation per client and mission prevent cross-client circulation of data, further enhanced by pseudonymisation and data minimisation practices. our solution also supports GDPR compliance through configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations, Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), audit logging of access and system outputs, and the appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO)." ;
